From 143b79a83a4e0965c82681bda223e77bde86e047 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:20:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] apn: import the samsung apn list

the pixel snapshot still lists turk telekom as avea, has no kktcell,
netgsm or xcap entries for turkey, has no entries for 1047 carriers
and mvnos that the one ui 9 list covers, and lacks ims, xcap,
emergency and mms profiles for many carriers it does list.
replace the turkish entries with the samsung ones and import the
rest from the samsung list, skipping rows whose types overlap an
existing upstream profile so no carrier gets a second default apn.
---
 merge-apns-conf.yaml |   105 +-
 samsung.xml          | 39361 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 39433 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 samsung.xml

